      "text": "Blockers / risks\n1. Testers need all report and scanner features without payment.\n2. Payment code should remain recoverable for later launch.\n3. Free mode must not write fake paid state into local storage.\n4. UI copy must not show prices or upgrade prompts during testing.\n5. Future agents need docs explaining why gates are bypassed.",
